		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "f620a384-90dd-4915-9157-749c4992788b")
		(at 80.5 124.05)
		(descr "JP19 heater block: TE 1971845-4 (LCSC C2149727), RAST 5 tab header, 4 x 6.3 x 0.8 mm tabs on 5 mm pitch, vertical THT, housing 22.3 x 14.9 x 12.8 mm, 16 A 250 V. Pattern from TE customer drawing C-1971845 rev A25, recommended PCB layout (solder side), redrawn from the component side and turned so the tabs run in a column: every tab has two tails 5 mm apart, staggered between odd and even positions, in 1.30 +0.10 mm holes, and a 2.50 mm hole takes the polarizing post. Only tabs 1 and 3 are wired, the two ends of the same boiler element.")
